{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello〜(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/26/wada.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本気で夏休みの宿題終わってない......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも序盤に終わらせるのに......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間ない時間ない！汗汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやとおんなじ〜！って方いるかな〜？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新幹線や飛行機の移動時間とか空いてるときできる限りやるのね？でも終わんないよ〜涙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも夏休み充実してるってことよね？\n乃木充〜＼(^-^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/26/image.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(災害がこれ以上広がりませんように...\n一人でも沢山の方の命が助かりますように...)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後残りの全国ツアーは名古屋2公演と明治神宮球場1公演となりました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆が盛り上がってくれるから\n楽しくライヴ出来て感謝してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと皆と楽しめるよう頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前呼んでくれたりサイリウム降ってくれたり♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"団扇やタオルが凄く嬉しいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*≧∀≦*)\n見つけると ギュッってしたいくらい♪\n本当にありがとう(*^O^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行けないけど応援してくれてるよってコメントありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちは同じ会場にいますよっ＼(^-^)／\n一緒に盛り上がろう〜(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"各地での食べ物も美味しかった〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪では美味しいたこ焼き食べたし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡では博多ラーメン食べたし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台では ずんだに牛タン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しいものたぁぁぁぁくさんっ食べれて幸せでしたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんにもメンバーにも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ほんとまあやは美味しそうにたべるよねっ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言われます(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっそう言えば、おばぁちゃんがめちゃ美味しそうに食べるんだよね〜o(*⌒―⌒*)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似たのかな？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテル福岡と仙台は二人部屋で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまと七瀬まるとでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまと七瀬まると楽しい時間過ごせましたっ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋は星みなと同じ部屋ですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルで起きたアンベリーバボーな話！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※以下のエピソード最後までよんで下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみはお湯が必要な食べ物かって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルのポットでお湯沸かそうと思ったらポットにもう水が入ってて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなったけどまぁ一回洗って買ってきた水入れたんですけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか沸騰しなくて......でもなんか温かくなったからカップにお湯注ごうとしたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら注ぐ口？のとこがなくて......でも頑張ってポットを持ってお湯ついで食べたのね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんで食べ終わって\nちょっとたってパッと端のほうみたらポットがあって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなったの、そしたらポットと加湿器間違えてて、みなみ加湿器でお湯沸かしてたの！笑笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばくない？o(*⌒―⌒*)o(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていうきっとこの文章伝わってないだろうなぁ......笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁいいや！めちゃ面白かったです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/26/wada2.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず最近和田まあやはどこでも寝れるようになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眠い......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/26/wada3.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のコメントありがとうございます\n一つ一つ大切に読んでます\n本当に読むのが楽しみだし、嬉しい！\n早く皆に逢いたいよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ次は名古屋だよ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみ〜ん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫！？今は体調直すことだけに専念して元気になってねっ......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く元気になりますように！\n皆でパワーを送るね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/25/7621229/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、いくちゃん ななみん 、これないお留守番のみんなに届くように熱いライブにしたいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気をつけて来てね＼(^-^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回各会場で物販Tシャツの色がちがうの♪わぁおっ\n名古屋はなんだろう〜(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにまあやたちは全部持ってる〜(●^o^●)いっぱい着よっ＼(^-^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨が多いから体調に気を付けてね＼(^-^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにしても乃木坂雨女多すぎ(*_*)(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天のキャンプにノギドコの留守電告白いかがでしたか？( 〃▽〃)(///ω///)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE (*^^*)"}],"source":"archive"}